---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Subscribe" description="New essays by RSS now; by email when the foundations are out.">
  <div class="page-wrap">
    <article class="read">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span>subscribe</span></div>
      <h1>New essays, when there are new essays.</h1>
      <p class="lede">No cadence, no filler. The foundations arc comes first, in order; the lanes open after it.</p>
      <div class="register-note">
        <p><strong>RSS, now:</strong> <a href="/rss.xml">centrehold.com/rss.xml</a> &mdash; every published essay, full text, the moment it lands.</p>
        <p><strong>Email, soon:</strong> the Substack mirror opens with the foundations arc. This page will carry the link.</p>
        <p><strong>Source:</strong> the essays are <a href="https://github.com/3r453r/centerhold">public markdown</a>; watch the repository if you prefer to read diffs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="after">
        <a href="/essays">&larr; the essays</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
